  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Up until recently you could disable forced poses in chairs by reloading your avatar through things like toggling OSC. \n\nThis was great because many vehicles (cars, jets, etc) require you to use a seat but force your avatar into a weird position if you were in full-body. \n\nNow with the newest update you can't do that anymore and with many vehicles you are stuck to the seat in weird poses without a way to fix things. \n\nWould appreciate an option to disable this and other animations for full-body users.",
